Bagel Shop Student 
<http://www.crosswalkmail.com/kfhdhflsdtdjlpsgjrkqbjwblfjpmkkptvlbhhglvpvdvhr_bglgdcjlzcpg.html> 


"Hello Mrs. Frobisher" said the bearded guy behind the counter at the 
bagel shop.

My husband and I looked at him but drew complete blanks. "I'm sorry, do 
we know each other?" I asked.

"Yeah, you was my English teacher."

Leaning over, my husband whispered, "Good job, Honey, good job."

